# spec: pre-request handler `< {% ... %}` above the request line
### signed
< {%
    const now = Date.now();
    request.variables.set("timestamp", now);
%}
POST https://example.com/signed
Content-Type: application/json

{"ts": "{{timestamp}}"}
### short-pre-request
< {% request.variables.set("nonce", "abc"); %}
GET https://example.com/nonce
